                                                                                
*                                                                               
*  FUNKTION   :  PGM-SKAPAR EN LISTA ÖVER RUBRIKTEXTER                          
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  GUNNEL ERIKSSON    880818                                      
*                                                                               
*  INFIL      :  W15106D1                                                       
*                                                                               
*  UTFIL      :  W15106D2  ELLER W15106D3                                       
*                                                                               
*  ÄNDRING    :  - ÄNDRAT TILL EPLUS FRÅN REPORT WRITER. G.E.                   
*  ÄNDRING    :  - ÄNDRAT TILL ATT UTSKRIFTEN STYRS TILL RÄTT                   
*             :           PRINTER MED IN-KDPRTVAL. C.E.                         
*  ÄNDRING    :  - ÄNDRAT, LAGT TILL DD-KORT FÖR PV-LISTA                       
*                                                                               
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVD                                  
*     880818..    GUNNEL ERIKSSON.....     36210.........                       
*     890531..    CONNY EGHOLT........     36210.........                       
*     911023..    CONNY EGHOLT........     30621.........                       
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*--------------------------INFIL------------------------------------            
  FILE  W15106D1                                                                
*                                                                               
 %W15105EE 'IN-'                                                                
*------------------------SORTFIL------------------------------------            
  FILE  W15106DS     FB (197 6107)                                              
*                                                                               
 %W15105EE 'SORT-'                                                              
*-------------------------PRINTFIL----------------------------------            
FILE W15106D4 PRINTER                                                           
*                        LISTA TILL PV                                          
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
 W-30-ASTERISKER            W 30 A VALUE +                                      
 '******************************'                                               
*                                                                               
 INDEX                      W  2 P  VALUE +0                                    
*                                                                               
 W-IDSKYLT                  W  3 A                                              
 W-SPRAK                    W 12 A                                              
 W-KDPRTVAL                 W  1 A  VALUE ' '                                   
*                                                                               
 W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR           W  5 N                                              
    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-1  W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR       1 N                              
    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-2  W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR +1    1 N                              
    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-3  W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR +2    1 N                              
    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-4  W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR +3    1 N                              
    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-5  W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR +4    1 N                              
*                                                                               
 %WWLANDEE                                                                      
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-KOD IDSKYLT 3 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (INDX)                                
                                                                                
SPRAK  W 240 A  VALUE +                                                         
                      'TYSKA       GERMAN      +                                
                       SPANSKA     SPANISH     +                                
                       FRANSKA     FRENCH      +                                
                       ENGELSKA    ENGLISH     +                                
                       ITALIENSKA  ITALIAN     +                                
                       HOLLÄNDSKA  DUTCH       +                                
                       PORTUGISISKAPORTUGUESE  +                                
                       SVENSKA     SWEDISH     +                                
                       FINSKA      FINNISH     +                                
                       AMERIKANSKA AMERICAN    '                                
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-TEXT  SPRAK 24 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (INDX)                               
 SPRAK-SPRAK SPRAK-TEXT 12 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                           
*                                                                               
*--------------------COPY-TEXT--------------------------------------            
 %WTXTAREA                                                                      
*                                                                               
*--------------------LIST-POST--------------------------------------            
 LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-1   W 30 A                                                
 LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-2   W 30 A                                                
 LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR      W  5 N, OCCURS (4) INDEX (INDX) MASK 'ZZZZZ'          
 LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK        W 12 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (INDX)                       
 LIST-RUBRIK-ASTERISK     W  7 A                                                
 LIST-RUBRIK-FLKOMBINERAS W  1 A                                                
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOB         *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
 SORT W15106D1 TO W15106DS USING (IN-RUB-IDRUBNR) +                             
 BEFORE SORT-PROC                                                               
*                                                                               
  SORT-PROC                                                                     
  PROC                                                                          
    IF W15106D1                                                                 
       SELECT                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-PROC                                                                      
*                                                                               
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOB         *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
JOB INPUT W15106DS                                                              
*                                                                               
 W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR = SORT-RUB-IDRUBNR                                            
 W-KDPRTVAL       = SORT-RUB-KDPRTVAL                                           
    S-IX = 1                                                                    
                                                                                
*A-BEARBETNING                                                                  
INDEX = +1                                                                      
DO WHILE  INDEX < 4                                                             
*                                                                               
    IF INDEX = 1                                                                
       IF SORT-RUB-FLKOMBINERAS = 'N'                                           
          LIST-RUBRIK-FLKOMBINERAS = SORT-RUB-FLKOMBINERAS                      
       END-IF                                                                   
*                                                                               
       W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR = SORT-RUB-IDRUBNR                                      
       PERFORM B-KOLLA-RUBRIKNUMMER                                             
*                                                                               
       W-IDSKYLT =  SORT-RUB-IDSKYLT-1                                          
       PERFORM C-KOLLA-SPRAK                                                    
       LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK(1) = W-SPRAK                                           
*                                                                               
       IF SORT-RUB-IDSKYLT-2 NE ' '                                             
          W-IDSKYLT = SORT-RUB-IDSKYLT-2                                        
          PERFORM C-KOLLA-SPRAK                                                 
          LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK(2) = W-SPRAK                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
*                                                                               
       IF SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-1(INDEX) = W-30-ASTERISKER                          
          MOVE '*' TO LIST-RUBRIK-ASTERISK FILL '*'                             
       ELSE                                                                     
          RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-1(INDEX)                            
          RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                   
          CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                       
          IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                  
             LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-1 = RTXT-TETEXTTR                             
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
*                                                                               
       IF SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-2(INDEX) NE ' '                                     
          IF SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-2(INDEX) = W-30-ASTERISKER                       
             MOVE '*' TO LIST-RUBRIK-ASTERISK FILL '*'                          
          ELSE                                                                  
             RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-2(INDEX)                         
             RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                
             CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                    
             IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                               
                LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-2 = RTXT-TETEXTTR                          
             END-IF                                                             
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
       IF W-KDPRTVAL = 'C'                                                      
         PRINT RAPPORT03                                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
       PERFORM D-NOLLSTÄLL-RAD-1                                                
    ELSE                                                                        
       IF SORT-RUB-FLKOMBINERAS = 'N'                                           
          RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-1(INDEX)                            
          RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                   
          CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                       
          IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                  
             LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-1 = RTXT-TETEXTTR                             
          END-IF                                                                
                                                                                
          RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-RUB-BERUBTXT-2(INDEX)                            
          RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                   
          CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                       
          IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                  
             LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-2 = RTXT-TETEXTTR                             
          END-IF                                                                
          IF W-KDPRTVAL = 'C'                                                   
            PRINT RAPPORT03                                                     
          END-IF                                                                
          PERFORM D-NOLLSTÄLL-RAD-1                                             
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
    INDEX = INDEX + 1                                                           
END-DO                                                                          
*                                                                               
B-KOLLA-RUBRIKNUMMER                                                            
PROC                                                                            
  IF W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR < 10000                                                   
     LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(1) = W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR                                  
  ELSE                                                                          
     IF    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-3 = +0 +                                            
       AND W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-4 = +0 +                                            
       AND W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-5 = +0                                              
            LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(1) = W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR                           
     ELSE                                                                       
        IF     W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-4 = +0 +                                        
          AND  W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-5 = +0                                          
               LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(2) = W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR                        
        ELSE                                                                    
            IF W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-5 = +0                                          
                LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(3) = W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR                       
            ELSE                                                                
                LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(4) = W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR                       
            END-IF                                                              
        END-IF                                                                  
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
C-KOLLA-SPRAK                                                                   
PROC                                                                            
INDX = 1                                                                        
DO WHILE INDX < 11                                                              
   IF SPRAK-KOD(INDX) = W-IDSKYLT                                               
      W-SPRAK = SPRAK-SPRAK(INDX, S-IX)                                         
      INDX = 10                                                                 
   END-IF                                                                       
   INDX = INDX + 1                                                              
END-DO                                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
D-NOLLSTÄLL-RAD-1                                                               
PROC                                                                            
  LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(1) = 0                                                    
  LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(2) = 0                                                    
  LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(3) = 0                                                    
  LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(4) = 0                                                    
  LIST-RUBRIK-FLKOMBINERAS    = ' '                                             
  LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK(1)        = ' '                                             
  LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK(2)        = ' '                                             
  LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-1      = ' '                                             
  LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-2      = ' '                                             
  LIST-RUBRIK-ASTERISK        = ' '                                             
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*-------------------------*                                                     
* REPORT  SECTION         *                                                     
*-------------------------*                                                     
*                                                                               
* PRINTER MED KDPRTVAL = C                                                      
*                                                                               
  REPORT RAPPORT03  PRINTER W15106D4  +                                         
                    LINESIZE 120    +                                           
                    NOADJUST        +                                           
                    NOHEADING       +                                           
                    NODATE                                                      
                                                                                
         CONTROL    FINAL NOPRINT  +                                            
                    W-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR-1 NEWPAGE +                                
                    NOPRINT                                                     
                                                                                
    TITLE 1 COL   4 'W15106-001 VOLVO CAR AFTERSALES.' +                        
            COL  38 'LISTA RUBRIKER' +                                          
            COL  90 'DATUM:' +                                                  
            COL  96  SYSDATE                                                    
*                                                                               
    TITLE 3 COL   4 'RUBRIKNUMMER' +                                            
            COL  25 'K' +                                                       
            COL  30  LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK(1) +                                     
            COL  43 '-----------------'   +                                     
            COL  64  LIST-RUBRIK-SPRAK(2) +                                     
            COL  77 '-----------------'   +                                     
            COL  98 'ÖVERSÄTTNING SAKNAS'                                       
*                                                                               
    TITLE 4 COL   5 '(1)' +                                                     
            COL  10 '(2)' +                                                     
            COL  15 '(3)' +                                                     
            COL  20 '(4)'                                                       
*                                                                               
    LINE  1 COL   4 LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(1)  +                                   
            COL   9 LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(2)  +                                   
            COL  14 LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(3)  +                                   
            COL  19 LIST-RUBRIK-IDRUBNR(4)  +                                   
            COL  25 LIST-RUBRIK-FLKOMBINERAS +                                  
            COL  30 LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-1   +                                  
            COL  64 LIST-RUBRIK-BERUBTXT-2   +                                  
            COL 110 LIST-RUBRIK-ASTERISK                                        
*                                                                               
*   LINE  2         ' '                                                         
